{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "eaf35a7c7decc53a22aadea762ea26f57a9c4de3e114340cef445974c4e61535", "ja": "ドラマのオーディション直前", "zh": "戏剧试镜开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2000_place", "source_sha256": "f80c789534c60be89e2cea52679c5f6a26b90abad9b901ee97b56e77af4cfd1d", "ja": "街中", "zh": "街上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2001_p", "source_sha256": "c2625983d90c6e3de2754ca6bcc81a37ff36324424b838ce1e780058d84edb18", "ja": "星梨花、今日のオーディションはチャンスだぞ！\n人気シリーズのレギュラーになれるかもしれないんだ。", "zh": "星梨花，今天的试镜是个机会喔！\n你说不定可以成为人气系列影集的固定班底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2002_022ser", "source_sha256": "bb461047d1c0761b58f3be9cda5541a7469db8b567f742a8ca46a99f9c9b62c3", "ja": "そうなんですね！　じゃあこのお仕事が\nうまくいったら、お給料がたくさんもらえますか？", "zh": "是这样啊！那如果这个工作顺利的话，\n也可以拿到很多薪水吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2003_p", "source_sha256": "eebac859b435f24cd55ec7d04828a7f93e6e270bc3af5ab01b1dca8e1a861653", "ja": "ん？　もちろん、お給料は増えるけど……\n星梨花、何かほしいものがあるのか？", "zh": "嗯？薪水当然是会增加……\n星梨花，你有什么想买的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2004_022ser", "source_sha256": "9859182a083f4b134147df9167db698487019225649f0992268da037b3ef35fe", "ja": "いいえ。わたしじゃなくて\n{$P$}さんのお給料です。", "zh": "不，不是我，\n是{$P$}先生的薪水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2005_022ser", "source_sha256": "b5dca766670b22b0e59dcbee14858fd97bf3bdb1301f68fc06561c2267fa6eb0", "ja": "いっぱいもらえたほうが、いいんですよね？\nわたし、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "可以拿到很多薪水比较好对吧？\n我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_2006_p", "source_sha256": "1d367092fa6882535acefc1905c25485473deb3bc3231cca9737ce08b5353d1c", "ja": "……星梨花、俺のお給料のことは\nあんまり気にしないでいいんだぞ。", "zh": "……星梨花，\n你不需要太在意我的薪水喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
